        "id": "a65f1d125d17f35a",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "LP-700-HID",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Prereq\r\n\r\nsudo apt-get install libudev-dev librtlsdr-dev libusb-1.0-0-dev libpthread-stubs0-dev\r\n\r\nnpm install robertsLando/node-red-contrib-usbhid\r\n\r\nsudo nano /etc/udev/rules.d/10-telepost.rules\r\n\r\n# this works, but is very generic\r\nKERNEL==\"hidraw*\",SUBSYSTEM==\"hidraw\", MODE:=\"777\", GROUP=\"telepost\"\r\n\r\nsudo udevadm control --reload-rules\r\nsudo groupadd -f telepost\r\nsudo gpasswd -a $USER telepost\r\n\r\nunplug/ replug\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom dmesg\r\n\r\nNew USB device found, idVendor=04d8, idProduct=0001, bcdDevice= 2.00\r\n[ 1325.646054] usb 1-1.2: New USB device strings: Mfr=1, Product=2, SerialNumber=3\r\n[ 1325.646072] usb 1-1.2: Product: LP-500\r\n[ 1325.646089] usb 1-1.2: Manufacturer: TelePost Inc.\r\n[ 1325.646106] usb 1-1.2: SerialNumber: 0x00000001"
