        "z": "a65f1d125d17f35a",
        "name": "LP-500 / LP-700 HID DIRECT v1.2 - KD4Z",
        "info": "\nKD4Z    1.0 Proof of concept\nKD4Z    1.1 Added 3 step automatic scaling for power bargraphs.  100W - 500W - 1500W\nKD4Z    1.2 Added Peak hold functionality for the power label values\n            Added Channel and Range button actions\n            Changed automatic scaling to follow what the meter is doing.\n\n",
